<title>HONG KONG: Zhejiang Expressway debuts at HK$2.75/shr.</title>
<headline>Zhejiang Expressway debuts at HK$2.75/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of toll road operator Zhejiang Expressway Co Ltd made their trading debut at HK$2.75 per share on Thursday, compared with their issue price of HK$2.38 each.</p>
</text>
